  "method": "python scripts/frosty-configuration.py --root \"C:/Users/royal/Documents/BF6 Datamining/Frosty\" --out <scratch>; base-projectile-configuration.json linkedCurves rawPoints. Site curves evaluated with sim/damage.js rules (clamp before first point, repeated range is a step, distinct ranges interpolate).",
