  "notes": [
    "equivalent-evaluation: the site keeps an extra 0 m point that the Frosty curve omits; damage is identical at every range because the curve clamps before its first point.",
    "M45A1: the raw Frosty curve (GRX TweakableDamageCurve.XYValues, flat Field_2ad7e688 and point list Field_6008eb31) goes from 54 m 14.3 directly to 75 m 12.5. The per-point mode Field_f275cba7 is the same value used on sniper ramps, so it does not show step behavior. An in-game test on 2026-09-13 showed a step: damage marker 14 and 7 body shots to kill below 75 m, marker 12 and 8 shots beyond 75 m. The site curve keeps the explicit 75 m 14.3 point. Non-sniper, non-shotgun curves are treated as stepped (scripts/damage.test.mjs)."
